Third-party attribution
-----------------------

The Sec-MS-GEC v2 token algorithm in src/drm.js is a JavaScript port of
`generate_sec_ms_gec_v2`, `_cs64_digest` and the related helpers from:

    rany2/edge-tts — https://github.com/rany2/edge-tts
    src/edge_tts/drm.py
    License: GPL-3.0

The algorithm itself was derived by the edge-tts contributors from Microsoft
Edge's native Read Aloud implementation. The WebSocket protocol and SSML
handling in src/tts.js follow the same public implementation.

This project is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Microsoft
Corporation. "Microsoft", "Edge" and "Read Aloud" are trademarks of Microsoft
Corporation.

